  "question": {
    "text": "<math><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi></math> is the chord of the parabola <math><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></math> (where <math><mi>O</mi></math> is the origin). <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></math> is a chord of <math><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;and perpendicular to <math><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi></math> which cuts the axis of the parabola at <math><mi>C</mi><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;If the foot of <math><mi>A</mi></math> on the axis of the parabola is <math><mi>D</mi></math>, then the length&nbsp;<math><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></math> is equal to",
    "image": null
  },
